# # /aleph/
#
# Namespace for Aleph Garden. Vocabularies are minted under /ns/<name>, their
# SHACL shapes under /ns/<name>/shapes, and terms in the hash namespace of the
# document each resolves to. Documents are served from
# https://github.com/aleph-garden/vocab, one file per vocabulary, so a new
# vocabulary needs no change here.
#
# The capture excludes dots and slashes, so a request cannot reach outside that
# directory or name a file other than <name>.ttl and <name>-shapes.ttl.
#
# These are working drafts, so redirects are 302. A redirect becomes 303 with
# content negotiation once its vocabulary is declared stable.
#
# ## Contact
# This space is administered by:
#
# Christopher Mühl
# toki@toph.so
# GitHub username: tophcodes

RewriteEngine on

RewriteRule ^ns/([a-z0-9-]+)$        https://aleph-garden.github.io/vocab/$1.ttl        [R=302,L]
RewriteRule ^ns/([a-z0-9-]+)/shapes$ https://aleph-garden.github.io/vocab/$1-shapes.ttl [R=302,L]
